16. SSH / LOCAL DEVICE MANAGEMENT
================================================================================
SW1(config)# hostname SW1
SW1(config)# ip domain-name lab.local
SW1(config)# username admin privilege 15 secret <strong-password>
SW1(config)# crypto key generate rsa modulus 2048
SW1(config)# ip ssh version 2
SW1(config)# line vty 0 4
SW1(config-line)# login local
SW1(config-line)# transport input ssh
SW1(config-line)# exit
SW1(config)# enable secret <strong-enable-password>

SW1# show ip ssh
SW1# show users
SW1# show line

NOTE: Configure a reachable management IP first. Key syntax varies on IOS XE.
      Avoid Telnet for management; prefer SSH and management access controls.

