TROUBLESHOOTING CHECKLIST
-------------------------
[1] Physical link UP?            show interfaces status
[2] Correct VLAN on access port? show vlan brief
[3] Correct trunk/native VLAN?   show interfaces trunk
[4] MAC address learned?         show mac address-table dynamic
[5] ARP resolves next hop?       show ip arp
[6] Correct IP/gateway/routes?   show ip interface brief / show ip route
[7] STP blocking port?           show spanning-tree
[8] Errors/duplex mismatch?      show interfaces <interface>
[9] ACL blocking traffic?        show ip access-lists
[10] Save intended changes?      copy running-config startup-config

