19. CONFIGURATION SAFETY / ROLLBACK BASICS
================================================================================
SW1# show archive                         ! If archive is configured
SW1# copy running-config startup-config
SW1# show startup-config
SW1# reload                               ! DISRUPTIVE: reboots device

CAUTION: Avoid 'erase startup-config', 'write erase', 'reload', 'clear ...',
         'shutdown', and VLAN/trunk changes on live networks without planning.
         This file is a study reference, not a copy-paste production script.

